{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01451",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 5.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.53,
      "end_seconds": 10.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.55,
      "end_seconds": 19.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.53,
      "text": "Honestly, it's an itchy patch on my wrist, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.92,
      "end_seconds": 22.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.61,
      "end_seconds": 29.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Four weeks, I think... sorry, three weeks, I got that wrong."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.02,
      "end_seconds": 40.44,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.62,
      "end_seconds": 53.11,
      "duration_seconds": 11.49,
      "text": "I get some relief from moisturiser. It happens a couple of times a week. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.33,
      "end_seconds": 58.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.4,
      "end_seconds": 68.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.47,
      "end_seconds": 95.87,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.9 degrees, blood pressure 119 over 77. And oxygen saturation is 97 percent, pulse 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.37,
      "end_seconds": 101.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.3,
      "end_seconds": 105.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.71,
      "end_seconds": 119.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "there's a neat red patch where the watch strap sits, with a little scaling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.7,
      "end_seconds": 127.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.95,
      "end_seconds": 145.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "And what about spreading or blisters?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.87,
      "end_seconds": 148.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.91,
      "end_seconds": 153.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Any sign of fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.18,
      "end_seconds": 158.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.02,
      "end_seconds": 163.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.52,
      "end_seconds": 166.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.31,
      "end_seconds": 182.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.42,
      "end_seconds": 186.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.55,
      "end_seconds": 190.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.67,
      "end_seconds": 194.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.09,
      "end_seconds": 197.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.13,
      "end_seconds": 202.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.64,
      "end_seconds": 207.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.83,
      "end_seconds": 212.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.68,
      "end_seconds": 231.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.82,
      "end_seconds": 240.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "I've had acid reflux for five years now. My neighbour said I should get it looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.87,
      "end_seconds": 245.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.49,
      "end_seconds": 250.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "no, I've never reacted to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.53,
      "end_seconds": 253.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "let's run through your medicines"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.71,
      "end_seconds": 271.41,
      "duration_seconds": 16.7,
      "text": "Hmm, it's omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. It's the not knowing that gets to me. I take a plain moisturiser, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.2,
      "end_seconds": 283.16,
      "duration_seconds": 9.96,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be mild contact dermatitis from the watch strap, or it might be eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.63,
      "end_seconds": 286.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.04,
      "end_seconds": 298.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's mild contact dermatitis from the watch strap, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.03,
      "end_seconds": 328.47,
      "duration_seconds": 12.44,
      "text": "I'm going to put you on hydrocortisone cream, 1%, once a day, one week. That should help with contact dermatitis. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.97,
      "end_seconds": 332.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Fine, I'll begin it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.34,
      "end_seconds": 355.59,
      "duration_seconds": 22.25,
      "text": "stop wearing that strap and keep the skin moisturised try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed the thing that would worry me is if it spreads or blisters if that happens, go to emergency"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.4,
      "end_seconds": 359.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "right, thank you, that's clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.75,
      "end_seconds": 367.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "come back if it has not cleared in two weeks have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.66,
      "end_seconds": 374.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.26,
      "end_seconds": 377.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "take care now"
    }
  ]
}